chived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-09-12T18:15:12Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T15:55:53Z","closed_at":"2026-09-18T15:48:03Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123452","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123452","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123452.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123452.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-18T15:48:03Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #122944 \r\n- Supersedes #123000 \r\n  - cc @shiva-kar \r\n\r\nDuring the initial implementation of maximum sizes, i.e., before desired sizes were a thing, in #116640, two types of `Container`, namely `BoxContainer` and `GridContainer`, were made to write to their children's `parent_maximum_size_cache` in order to \"clip\" children with a minimum size greater than their true minimum size (i.e., children with a desired size). This became outdated and dangerous (well it was always dangerous), as seen in #12944, when #118651 introduced the desired size system. However, the code was left in place. \r\n\r\nThis PR removes that code, stopping the infinite layout loops that caused crashes. \r\nIn doing so, it also preserves/returns the proper space splitting as introduced in #120640, as can be seen below (scene from issue MRP):\r\n<img width=\"545\" height=\"215\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/be53afae-35e0-4f6e-a8a1-43aa795b922d\" />\r\n\r\nThis PR also fixes another issue that cropped up with that bug report, namely that `PanelContainer` (and `MarginContainer`) weren't using `get_bound_desired_size()` when computing their own desired sizes, and instead used `get_desired_size()` which made it twice as big as it should be in the issue MRP. \r\n\r\nFinally, I added a clarification to the docs to use `clip_contents` when using a maximum size in `Container` types. Without the bug fix, the maximum size of a `BoxContainer`/`GridContainer` would act as though `clip_contents` was on, but this was an unintended side effect of the \"we don't have desired sizes\" thingy. This behavior was not intended. We have a property for it. Since it does represent a change in behavior and is something relatively important, I've added the documentation note.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123452/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":4,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123452/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}